  },
  "caveats": [
    "Wordmark depends on Space Grotesk Light — outline it for production artwork.",
    "The baseline tagline (\"INTELLIGENCE PROJET · SOURCÉE\") is NOT validated — to be defined; removed from all artwork here.",
    "Fonts sourced from Google Fonts OFL; swap for licensed masters if required.",
    "Logo + icon artwork copied from the validated source project (0b56b66b); this pack formalizes that DA, it does not re-invent it.",
